# LaTeX build intermediates. The PDF itself IS committed: it is the deliverable, and a report
# nobody can open without a TeX installation is not one.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
# And the files latexmk and the DVI path write, with the build directory itself (2026-10-29). Two of
# them were tracked under out/ and carried an absolute local path: the patterns above did not cover
# them, and `report/*.fls` in the top-level .gitignore does not match report/out/.
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.dvi
*.synctex.gz
out/
